{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスダンス♪\n一曲踊っただけで汗がどーっと流れる人です。\nふぃ...代謝良すぎて逆に心配になるぜ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****\n全国握手会のレーンが決まりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は第5レーン\nれいか、ななせ、まりか、ゆきな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくわくどきどきしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にぎにぎ楽しみだよーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話変わって\nもう高校2年生かぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうよ私は\n小学生でもなく中学生でもなく\n高校生だかんね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校2年生だかんねっ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...えっ   そう見えない⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見えないて言ったろっ\nまりかには全部聞こえてるぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がうっちするぞ、うらっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"い\"ーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふんっっっ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ん、暴走した"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あうちっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかものとか\n手に当たって痛かったり\nこぼしたり落としたりするとき\n「あうちっ」\nて言ってしまう。\nくせかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では質問回答するぞい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"............."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"僕もてへぺろよくわかんないです(笑)\nベビたんの予想ではどんな意味ですか??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あーんもうっ、でもしょーがないっか☆」\n←この☆が重要"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、当たってるよね☆てへぺろっ\n...言ったそばからこの文おかしいよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私には難しいね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今俺はちょっと調子に乗りすぎて\n失敗しちゃったことがあり\nずいぶん落ち込んじゃってます。（−＿−；）\nまりかちんはこんな時どうしてますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もです。\n調子に乗っちゃうと、\nどうしても周りが見えなくなるというか\n空気読めなくなって...その以前に\nもともと空気読めてない人なので...\n失敗するし、周りからも注意されることがあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失敗してその日は\n「あーなんであんなことしたんだろ。」\nてずっと考え込んじゃうx("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも考え込んでも仕方がないから\n次は失敗しないようにって\n周りをよく見るようにしてます。\n気を遣うことって大事だな、と\n気を遣いすぎるのはおかしいけども"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きすぎるんですけど\nどうすればいいですか(＞ω＜)??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございますーー><"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかも乃木坂family好きすぎて\nどうしたらよいかわからん><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きすぎて熱が出たら看病します。‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト終ったら万理華ちゃんにお手紙書くね!!!\n待ってて待っててー??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい‼待ってますとも‼いつまでも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント全部見てるの？？\nなまら使ってよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント全部読んでます＊\n北海道弁ね^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもどうしてもめっちゃになるの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかはもともと関西人だし、しょーがないか\nてあったかく見守っててくださいx(**"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"古着屋は高円寺なんだ。下北とかは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー高円寺行ったことないんだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下北ときどき行くよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりりんは服飾系とかデザイン系の\n勉強とかしようと思った事ある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごーーーーい興味ある"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参考にしてる雑誌とかある??\nベビ先輩見たいなコーデしてみたい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FUDGEとか装苑とか好きで\nたまに見るんだけど、\nベビたんは何かファッション誌とか\n読んだりしてますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はあんまり買ってないけど、\nときどき読んでるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FUDGEも装苑も読んでるー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真はこれ以上大きくならないんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ならないのー泣\nごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポンチョ来てる子は誰でも可愛いね！(笑)\nポンチョ可愛いＯ(≧∇≦)Ｏ !!\nまりちゃんもポンチョ来てみては？(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポンチョの形私もすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニットの持ってるけども..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう春だ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャーナル以外はどんなブランドで\nお洋服買ってるのかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャーナル好きなの？\n他にはどんなセレクトショップ行く？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャーナルのはほとんどママさんのおさがりだよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変わった服すきかなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラフォーレとかよく行きます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モノトーン目の恰好って\nベビたん的に結構珍しかったりするのかな?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやっ、逆にモノトーンが多いかも‼\n小物も黒が多い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使いまわし便利なのは黒なのかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"............."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/5569242/0025.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くみなさんに会ってぎゅーーーしたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}